WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:04.269
In Berlin, Acme's team needs
the launch deck in German,

2
00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:06.550
and every slide is in English.

3
00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:08.810
Drive holds only the English deck,

4
00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:13.410
and translated text rarely takes
the same space as the English.

5
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:18.660
General Translation lets you choose
languages in the Locadex add-on and click

6
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:19.850
Sync and apply.

7
00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:24.670
With Google Drive connected to
General Translation, open Extensions,

8
00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:26.150
then Locadex.

9
00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:30.730
Under Translate into, choose
German and the other languages,

10
00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:33.070
then click Sync and apply.

11
00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:38.750
Locadex translates the text, then
formats each slide so the new text fits.

12
00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:43.470
The slides keep their layout in the
Japanese, Chinese and German copies.

13
00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:46.690
Each copy sits next to
the original in Drive.
